    "title": "Bike Stunt Extreme Bike Racing",
    "description": "Playing city superhero motor bike racer is always fun, but it is more important to become the real moto rider bike racer champion and complete all the levels in this city superhero moto rider racing game. In superhero mega vertical ramp stunts speed bike rider driving game there are two modes to play i.e stunts mode within time limit and the free racing mode. Master your skills in mega stunt bike riding, sky bike challenges and race against time and then challenge other motorcycle riding opponents.\r\n\u2022 Tilt your device / Press Left Right buttons to control mega ramp bike\r\n\u2022 Use Nitro to boost up your stunt bike in motor bike stunts\r\n\u2022 Use the handbrake to reduce the impossible motorbike speed\r\n\u2022 Avoid obstacles and perform impossible tracks stunt\r\n\u2022 Don\u2019t speed up while performing impossible track stunt",
    "descriptionHTML": "Playing city superhero motor bike racer is always fun, but it is more important to become the real moto rider bike racer champion and complete all the levels in this city superhero moto rider racing game. In superhero mega vertical ramp stunts speed bike rider driving game there are two modes to play i.e stunts mode within time limit and the free racing mode. Master your skills in mega stunt bike riding, sky bike challenges and race against time and then challenge other motorcycle riding opponents.<br>\u2022 Tilt your device / Press Left Right buttons to control mega ramp bike<br>\u2022 Use Nitro to boost up your stunt bike in motor bike stunts<br>\u2022 Use the handbrake to reduce the impossible motorbike speed<br>\u2022 Avoid obstacles and perform impossible tracks stunt<br>\u2022 Don\u2019t speed up while performing impossible track stunt",
